<p>Strike twice with your mainhand weapon dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">77%, 85%, 90%, 95%, 100%</acronym> Arcane damage.</p><p>If either of these attacks hit you gain <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">34, 46, 55, 63, 70</acronym> mana.</p><p>The mana gain will increase with your Spellpower.</p>